{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/scarred-lands/969468-scarred-lands-players-guide-how-are-you-guys-liking-it-so-far","id":969468,"title":"Scarred lands players guide: how are you guys liking it so far?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scarred Lands"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-09-14T14:49:14-07:00","id":969468,"title":"Scarred lands players guide: how are you guys liking it so far?","content":"Personally I am mostly enjoying it. I'm pathfinder exclusive, I couldn't even pick out the 5th edition players handbook cover out of a lineup. I like the craft feats but I feel the one that allows the creation of grand masterwork melee weapons needs more oomph. I wish it included forsaken elves, but I kinda get that this is about Ghelspad. The inclusion of the &quot;redeemed&quot; races was a bit of a shock but upon reflections really like it. Now I just need to find a group so I can make my conjurer who dreams of making a new skykeep.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/398-rat_bastard","name":"rat_bastard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar398_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-15T04:16:37-07:00","id":969811,"title":"","content":"So far, so good! I do like the redeemed races and the hollow legionnaire, and most of the other small details can be safely ignored by the GM if need be <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I'm not going to discuss the rules, because I don't play/like PF anyway XD","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Alain%20Giorla\" target=\"_blank\">Slarecian Vault contributions</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5793-haaz","name":"haaz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5793_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"66"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-17T05:45:21-07:00","id":971274,"title":"","content":"It is definitely written as a player's guide. At least in the nations, unless Calistia's queen got hit by retcon as well.<br /> <br /> \u200b(Yeah, I almost wrote Calistria there. I also still think of the silver stormtrooper in TFA as &quot;Captain Pharasma&quot; too.)<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4034-the_livewire","name":"The_Livewire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4034_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"138"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-19T10:29:33-07:00","id":972590,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>rat_bastard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/scarred-lands/969468-scarred-lands-players-guide-how-are-you-guys-liking-it-so-far#post969468\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Personally I am mostly enjoying it. I'm pathfinder exclusive, I couldn't even pick out the 5th edition players handbook cover out of a lineup. I like the craft feats but I feel the one that allows the creation of grand masterwork melee weapons needs more oomph. I wish it included forsaken elves, but I kinda get that this is about Ghelspad. The inclusion of the &quot;redeemed&quot; races was a bit of a shock but upon reflections really like it. Now I just need to find a group so I can make my conjurer who dreams of making a new skykeep.</div> </div> </div> </div>You'll be happy to know that the forsaken elves are included as a new race in <i>The Wise and The Wicked,</i> which is likely going off to its first round of layout today or tomorrow. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12432-scott-holden","name":"Scott Holden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12432_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}